      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><label for=\"ds-token\">Owner token</label><div class=\"ds-field-wrap\"><input id=\"ds-token\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"서버의 인증키를 붙여넣으세요\" aria-describedby=\"ds-help\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-reveal\" aria-label=\"인증키 표시\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M2 12s4-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-4 7-10 7S2 12 2 12Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg></button></div><p id=\"ds-help\">ChatGPT 비밀번호가 아닌 서버 소유자 인증키입니다.</p></div>",
