      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-steps\" aria-label=\"진행 과정\"><li class=\"ds-complete\"><span class=\"ds-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m7 12 3 3 7-7\"/></svg></span><strong>요청 확인</strong></li><li class=\"ds-current\" aria-current=\"step\"><span class=\"ds-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span></span><strong>소유자 인증</strong></li><li><span class=\"ds-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>채팅으로 돌아가기</strong></li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-steps{font-family:Portlane,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink,#122143);list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.ds-steps li{display:flex;gap:20px;position:relative;padding-bottom:38px;min-height:92px}.ds-steps li:not(:last-child):after{content:'';position:absolute;top:30px;bottom:5px;left:12px;width:1px;background:#b8c4d5}.ds-mark{width:26px;height:26px;border:1px solid #9dadc2;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-complete .ds-mark{background:#536f9b;border-color:#536f9b}.ds-mark svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:white;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-current .ds-mark{background:var(--accent,#2457d6);border-color:var(--accent,#2457d6)}.ds-current .ds-mark span{width:6px;height:6px;background:white;border-radius:50%}.ds-current strong{color:var(--accent,#2457d6)}.ds-steps strong{font-size:18px;font-weight:680}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "네이티브 펼침으로 추가 도움말을 제공하며 reduced-motion을 지원한다.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-disclosure\"><summary>인증키는 어디서 찾나요?</summary><p>서버의 Portlane 설치 폴더에서 확인합니다. 인증키는 이 서버의 승인 화면에만 입력하세요.</p></details>",
      "css": ".ds-disclosure{font-family:Portlane,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink,#122143);font-size:14px}.ds-disclosure summary{width:fit-content;cursor:pointer}.ds-disclosure p{color:var(--muted,#52647c);margin:10px 0 0;max-width:75ch}.ds-disclosure summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#2457d6);outline-offset:4px}.ds-disclosure[open]{animation:ds-disclose .22s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}@keyframes ds-disclose{from{clip-path:inset(0 0 22% 0)}to{clip-path:inset(0)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-disclosure[open]{animation:none}}"
